TITLE:: CompressorGUI
summary:: one compressor in a window of its own
categories:: Libraries>Compressor
related:: Classes/Compressor, Classes/CompressorPanel

DESCRIPTION::
A link::Classes/CompressorPanel::, a status line saying where the compressor is
running and what it listens to, and a link::Classes/FxHintBar:: under it. What
code::comp.gui:: opens.

code::
c = Compressor.onBus(0, 2);
c.gui;
c.guiObj.close;
::

